<view class="section-card">
  <view class="section-title">复试专业课高频题整理表</view>
  <view class="section-subtitle">
    覆盖 20 个热门专业的核心考点、追问角度与冲刺任务，并提供 360 分以上、国家线-360 分、国家线以下三个分数段的院校组合。
  </view>
</view>

<view class="section-card">
  <view class="section-title">分数段策略与院校推荐</view>
  <picker mode="selector" value="{{majorIndex}}" range="{{majorOptions}}" bindchange="handleMajorChange">
    <view class="picker-trigger">
      <text>{{majorOptions[majorIndex]}}</text>
      <text>▼</text>
    </view>
  </picker>
  <view class="card-grid">
    <block wx:for="{{scoreBandGuides}}" wx:key="key" wx:for-item="guide">
      <view class="card">
        <view class="tag {{guide.key === 'low' ? 'tag-warning' : ''}}">{{guide.title}}</view>
        <view class="card-body">{{guide.subtitle}}</view>
        <view class="card-body" style="margin-top: 12rpx;">
          {{guide.key === 'low'
            ? '请结合下方院校清单评估调剂机会或准备下一轮冲刺，维持每天至少 2 小时的复盘节奏。'
            : '锁定下方表格中的目标院校组合，提前研究导师课题组与参考书单。'}}
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="section-card">
  <view class="section-title">热门专业速览</view>
  <scroll-view scroll-x="true" class="table-scroll" enable-flex="true">
    <view class="table" style="min-width: 1600rpx;">
      <view class="table-row table-header">
        <view class="table-cell col-major">热门专业</view>
        <view class="table-cell col-topics">高频考点</view>
        <view class="table-cell col-angles">追问角度</view>
        <view class="table-cell col-tasks">冲刺练习任务</view>
        <view class="table-cell col-schools">360 分以上推荐院校</view>
        <view class="table-cell col-schools">国家线-360 分推荐院校</view>
        <view class="table-cell col-schools">国家线以下推荐院校</view>
      </view>
      <block wx:for="{{displayedRecommendations}}" wx:key="major" wx:for-item="major">
        <view class="table-row">
          <view class="table-cell col-major">
            <view class="card-title" style="font-size: 28rpx;">{{major.major}}</view>
            <view class="badge">热门</view>
          </view>
          <view class="table-cell col-topics">
            <block wx:for="{{major.coreTopics}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="topic">
              <view>• {{topic}}</view>
            </block>
          </view>
          <view class="table-cell col-angles">
            <block wx:for="{{major.questionAngles}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="angle">
              <view>• {{angle}}</view>
            </block>
          </view>
          <view class="table-cell col-tasks">
            <block wx:for="{{major.practiceTasks}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="task">
              <view>• {{task}}</view>
            </block>
          </view>
          <view class="table-cell col-schools">
            <block wx:for="{{major.recommendedSchools.high}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="school">
              <view>🏆 {{school}}</view>
            </block>
          </view>
          <view class="table-cell col-schools">
            <block wx:for="{{major.recommendedSchools.mid}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="school">
              <view>🎯 {{school}}</view>
            </block>
          </view>
          <view class="table-cell col-schools">
            <block wx:for="{{major.recommendedSchools.low}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="school">
              <view>🛠 {{school}}</view>
            </block>
          </view>
        </view>
      </block>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="empty-hint" wx:if="{{displayedRecommendations.length === 0}}">暂无可展示的院校数据，请稍后再试。</view>
</view>

<view class="section-card" wx:if="{{focusedMajor}}">
  <view class="section-title">{{focusedMajor.major}} · 快速聚焦清单</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-body">
      <view class="list">
        <view class="card-title" style="font-size: 28rpx; margin-bottom: 12rpx;">高频考点</view>
        <block wx:for="{{focusedMajor.coreTopics}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="topic">
          <view class="list-item">
            <view class="list-dot"></view>
            <view>{{topic}}</view>
          </view>
        </block>
      </view>
      <view class="list">
        <view class="card-title" style="font-size: 28rpx; margin: 24rpx 0 12rpx;">常见追问</view>
        <block wx:for="{{focusedMajor.questionAngles}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="angle">
          <view class="list-item">
            <view class="list-dot"></view>
            <view>{{angle}}</view>
          </view>
        </block>
      </view>
      <view class="list">
        <view class="card-title" style="font-size: 28rpx; margin: 24rpx 0 12rpx;">冲刺任务</view>
        <block wx:for="{{focusedMajor.practiceTasks}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="task">
          <view class="list-item">
            <view class="list-dot"></view>
            <view>{{task}}</view>
          </view>
        </block>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="section-card">
  <view class="section-title">使用建议</view>
  <view class="card-body">
    建议将表格导出为电子笔记或打印为 A3 尺寸，模拟面试后及时补充导师反馈。跨专业考生可先完成核心考点自测，再补充能够连接本科背景的跨界案例。
  </view>
</view>
